#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:2
msgid "SageMaker HyperPod"
msgstr "SageMaker HyperPod"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:4
msgid ""
"An L2 adapter backed by the **ai-toolkit** daemon of Amazon SageMaker "
"HyperPod, which provides shared memory access for LMCache."
msgstr "一个由 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 的 **ai-toolkit** 守护进程支持的 L2 适配器，提供 LMCache 的共享内存访问。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:7
msgid "**Required fields:**"
msgstr "**必填字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:9
msgid "``url``: ai-toolkit daemon URL (``sagemaker-hyperpod://host:port``)."
msgstr "``url``: ai-toolkit 守护进程 URL (``sagemaker-hyperpod://host:port``)。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:11
msgid "**Optional fields:**"
msgstr "**可选字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:13
msgid "``bucket`` (string, default ``\"lmcache\"``): ai-toolkit cache namespace."
msgstr "``bucket`` (字符串，默认 ``\"lmcache\"``)：ai-toolkit 缓存命名空间。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:14
msgid ""
"``shared_memory_name`` (string, default ``\"shared_memory\"``): Name of "
"shared memory segment."
msgstr "``shared_memory_name`` (string, default ``\\\"shared_memory\\\"``): 共享内存段的名称。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:16
msgid ""
"``max_concurrent_requests`` (int, default ``100``): Maximum concurrent "
"HTTP requests."
msgstr "``max_concurrent_requests`` (int, default ``100``): 最大并发 HTTP 请求数。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:18
msgid ""
"``max_connections`` (int, default ``256``): Total HTTP connection-pool "
"limit."
msgstr "``max_connections`` (int, default ``256``): 总的 HTTP 连接池限制。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:20
msgid ""
"``max_connections_per_host`` (int, default ``128``): Per-host connection "
"limit."
msgstr "``max_connections_per_host`` (int, default ``128``): 每个主机的连接限制。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:22
msgid "``timeout_ms`` (int, default ``5000``): HTTP transport timeout."
msgstr "``timeout_ms`` (int, default ``5000``): HTTP 传输超时。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:23
msgid ""
"``lease_wait_timeout_ms`` (int, default ``1000``): How long the daemon "
"may hold a lease request before answering."
msgstr "``lease_wait_timeout_ms`` (int, default ``1000``): 守护进程在回答之前可以持有租约请求的时间。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:25
msgid "``lease_ttl_ms`` (int, default ``30000``): Server-side lease lifetime."
msgstr "``lease_ttl_ms`` (int, default ``30000``): 服务器端租约生命周期。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:26
msgid "``put_stream_chunk_bytes`` (int, default ``65536``): HTTP PUT chunk size."
msgstr "``put_stream_chunk_bytes`` (int, default ``65536``): HTTP PUT 块大小。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:27
msgid ""
"``max_lease_size_mb`` (float, optional): Upper bound for accepted lease "
"payloads."
msgstr "``max_lease_size_mb`` (float, optional): 接受的租约有效负载的上限。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:29
msgid "``use_https`` (bool, default ``false``): Enable HTTPS instead of HTTP."
msgstr "``use_https`` (bool, default ``false``): 启用 HTTPS 而不是 HTTP。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:31
msgid "**Configuration examples:**"
msgstr "**配置示例：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:42
msgid "Kubernetes Deployment Requirements"
msgstr "Kubernetes 部署要求"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:44
msgid ""
"The ai-toolkit daemon is node-local (hostNetwork, port 9200), so the "
"LMCache server must run on the same node as the daemon."
msgstr "ai-toolkit 守护进程是节点本地的（hostNetwork，端口 9200），因此 LMCache 服务器必须在与守护进程相同的节点上运行。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:48
msgid "Environment Variable for Node IP"
msgstr "节点 IP 的环境变量"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:50
msgid ""
"Add the ``NODE_IP`` environment variable to resolve the local node's IP "
"address:"
msgstr "添加 ``NODE_IP`` 环境变量以解析本地节点的 IP 地址："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:62
msgid "/dev/shm Volume Configuration"
msgstr "/dev/shm 卷配置"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/sagemaker_hyperpod.rst:64
msgid ""
"SageMaker Hyperpod requires /dev/shm for high-performance shared memory "
"operations:"
msgstr "SageMaker Hyperpod 需要 /dev/shm 以进行高性能共享内存操作："

